    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Last Gamble</strong> is a surreal narrative-driven game about redemption, choices, and the weight of loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake each night in a casino that feels both familiar and haunting. Every hand of blackjack is more than just a game\u2014it\u2019s a struggle against doubt, regret, and the echo of mistakes that refuse to fade. The deeper you play, the louder your heart beats, pulling you between hope and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But winning here isn\u2019t about money. It\u2019s about confronting yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreamlike blackjack gameplay with escalating tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven inner monologue exploring regret and redemption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack blending heartbeat, silence, and surreal casino sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prologue rooted in reality, a story told through dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated to all restless minds\u2014because gambling takes more than money</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will this be your redemption\u2026 or just another hand lost to the night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music: &quot;Unbreakable Resolve&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artist: Lunar Years (Bensound)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licensed under code: PPJLRPJ4HQ8J12NL</strong></p>",
